# The end-to-end suite's own files. `.vscode-test/` holds a whole downloaded
# VS Code, so packaging after a test run would otherwise produce a VSIX
# hundreds of megabytes large; the rest is test code with no business
# shipping. `src/**` already covers the sources, but `out/test/` is build
# output and is not.
.vscode-test/**
.vscode-test.mjs
tsconfig.test.json
out/test/**
